      "text": "## How to Use This Kanban\n\n1. **Backlog**: All ready tasks (query: status=ready)\n2. **To Do**: Pick 1-3 for today (drag from Backlog)\n3. **Doing**: Keep active work < 2 tasks (drag here when starting)\n4. **Done**: Mark complete at end of day (move here)\n5. **Archive**: Weekly, move done tasks to notes/archive/\n\nEach card links to the task file. Click to edit.",
